-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Demo catalogue: 10 products in each of the 19 leaf categories (190 total), each with
-- 2-5 size variants. Products only hang off leaf categories, so Men / Women / Children
-- get theirs through their children.
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- No ids are hardcoded: categories are found by slug and products are joined back to their
-- sizes on (category, name), so this applies cleanly on a database that already has rows.
-- SKUs are DEMO-<CATEGORY-SLUG>-<NN>-<SIZE>, which keeps them clear of real ones.
-- No thumbnails: the storefront draws its watermark tile for a product without an image.

